  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://spec.matrix.org/v1.3/client-server-api/#client-config\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\n\r\nThe spec only says that\r\n\r\n> The account_data may be either global or scoped to a particular rooms.\r\n\r\nand mentions that per-room data will appear in the account_data section of a room in /sync.\r\n\r\nWe do not specify:\r\n\r\n- if you should be able to store account data for rooms that you aren't joined to\r\n- what happens to your per-room account data after you leave, are kicked or banned from a room. Is it removed? Does it persist indefinitely?",
